{
  "name": "节日壁炉台",
  "icon": "minecraft:writable_book",
  "category": "merrymaking:mantels",
  "pages": [
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "寒冷夜晚，围坐在温暖壁炉旁，惬意十足。这些节日壁炉台支持装饰，是伴着炉火啜饮热可可的绝佳之选。$(br2)壁炉台宽3格、高3格、深1格，以你放置的位置为中心。$(br2)如何装饰？请继续阅读……"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
      "name": "节日壁炉台",
      "multiblock": {
        "mapping": {
          "A": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=0]",
          "B": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=1]",
          "C": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=2]",
          "D": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=3]",
          "E": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=4]"
        },
        "pattern": [
          [
            "DCB"
          ],
          [
            "E0A"
          ]
        ],
        "symmetrical": true
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "节日壁炉台可通过点击各部位，使用任意类型的水平花环和/或长筒袜进行装饰。$(br2)如需在两端形成转角效果，只需再放置一段同款花环即可。$(br2)空手点击壁炉台，即可移除所有装饰。$(br2)相关配方请继续阅读……"
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:multiblock",
      "name": "壁炉台装饰",
      "multiblock": {
        "mapping": {
          "A": "merrymaking:oak_mantel[facing=west,section=0,type=garland]",
